The code checks if KVM (Kernel-based Virtual Machine) is enabled, and if so, it locks two mutexes: `qemu_fair_mutex` and `qemu_global_mutex`. After locking these mutexes, it unlocks `qemu_fair_mutex` but leaves `qemu_global_mutex` locked. 

